      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A hub its purpose is to connect all network devices on an internal network",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A hub its purpose is to connect all network devices on an internal network",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sHUrSARAlvqcZ3509CC33",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 857.11111111111,
      "y": 1746.2020202020208,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1634676607,
      "version": 165,
      "versionNonce": 272471007,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493226106,
      "created": 1791060274945,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "its a device that has multiple ports that accept ethernet connections from\nnetwork devices",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "its a device that has multiple ports that accept ethernet connections from network devices",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "X8gJxC9OaEl_XaQg0b7eO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 859.3333333333322,
      "y": 1808.424242424243,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2073404945,
      "version": 391,
      "versionNonce": 1258118545,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493226106,
      "created": 1791060367337,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A hub is not intelligent to filter any data or to where the data is supposed to\nbe sent , and that is because the only thing a hub know is when a device is\nconnected to one of its ports , so when a data is arrived to one of its ports\nits copied to all of the other ports",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A hub is not intelligent to filter any data or to where the data is supposed to be sent , and that is because the only thing a hub know is when a device is connected to one of its ports , so when a data is arrived to one of its ports its copied to all of the other ports",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HbHrq5KvGrADFLtNElmxc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 868.222222222221,
      "y": 1932.8686868686873,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 151766271,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 1950203903,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493226106,
      "created": 1791060699998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The hub rebroadcast every arrived data packet to all its ports that has a\ndevice connected to it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The hub rebroadcast every arrived data packet to all its ports that has a device connected to it",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
