      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493232106,
      "created": 1791493226806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A hub its purpose is to connect all network devices on an internal network",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A hub its purpose is to connect all network devices on an internal network",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SOiXt03z18m2y3fc1aaq6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4106.11111111111,
      "y": 3607.800275548997,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1844649585,
      "version": 168,
      "versionNonce": 14248145,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493232106,
      "created": 1791493226806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "its a device that has multiple ports that accept ethernet connections from\nnetwork devices",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "its a device that has multiple ports that accept ethernet connections from network devices",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_mLT_hsQKofMTfWKs7bez",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4108.333333333332,
      "y": 3670.0224977712187,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 197666897,
      "version": 394,
      "versionNonce": 577439935,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493232106,
      "created": 1791493226806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A hub is not intelligent to filter any data or to where the data is supposed to\nbe sent , and that is because the only thing a hub know is when a device is\nconnected to one of its ports , so when a data is arrived to one of its ports\nits copied to all of the other ports",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A hub is not intelligent to filter any data or to where the data is supposed to be sent , and that is because the only thing a hub know is when a device is connected to one of its ports , so when a data is arrived to one of its ports its copied to all of the other ports",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TaL7BKwdjIjZqbnf8xxaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4117.222222222222,
      "y": 3794.466942215663,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 572585521,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 1412834993,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493232106,
      "created": 1791493226806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The hub rebroadcast every arrived data packet to all its ports that has a\ndevice connected to it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The hub rebroadcast every arrived data packet to all its ports that has a device connected to it",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
