    {
      "id": "SrCa1bxyS2GZfpEBfUwji",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200.6092768417293,
      "y": 4658.046882555811,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 87249041,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 1408743583,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791493232107,
      "created": 1791493226806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At the network cable/Wi-Fi level\n\nThe computer receives:\n\nbits → Ethernet frame\n\nThe network interface card (NIC) processes the Ethernet frame.\n\nThen the operating system extracts the IP packet:\n\nEthernet frame → IP packet\n\nThen the IP layer processes the packet and passes the payload to TCP/UDP,\nthen to the application.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At the network cable/Wi-Fi level\n\nThe computer receives:\n\nbits → Ethernet frame\n\nThe network interface card (NIC) processes the Ethernet frame.\n\nThen the operating system extracts the IP packet:\n\nEthernet frame → IP packet\n\nThen the IP layer processes the packet and passes the payload to TCP/UDP, then to the application.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XdddDur7C-NyEzyzn9VCq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3210.3870546195067,
      "y": 4612.04688255581,
      "width": 295.51971435546875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
